WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Review webhook configuration. Open Dev Tools > Endpoints. These demo destinations are disabled placeholders.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Inspect the endpoint. Check its environment, subscriptions, signing method, timeout and retry policy.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Select the events your receiver needs. Use your own public HTTPS destination. Never copy the example.invalid demo URL.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Keep the signing secret private. Store the secret securely and verify signatures in your receiver. No secret is displayed here.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Open Deliveries & events. Recorded means the business event exists. It does not prove delivery.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Check Delivery attempts. This event has no attempts. The demonstration site does not send outbound webhooks.

7
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Read the event payload. Use event ID for deduplication and resource ID to find the current API record.

8
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Follow Related records. Inspect the associated borrower when investigating a notification.
